n+m = \frac{1}{6 \log t} \left( \frac{2m+\kappa_{15}n+1}{t^3} + \frac{5/2+\kappa_{16} m}{t^6} +\frac{25}{3 t^9} + \frac{\kappa_{14}}{t^{12}} \right).
